# name: test/sql/security/external_access.test
# description: ATTACH of a Hive Metastore follows enable_external_access
# group: [security]

require hive_metastore

statement ok
SET enable_external_access = false

statement error
ATTACH 'thrift://127.0.0.1:9083' AS hms (TYPE hive_metastore)
----
Attaching Hive Metastore catalogs is disabled through configuration
